```mdl
verdict FeedOptionsIntentStore: migrate, record, take and clear exist with the specified semantics; the intent nests its options.
  status: diverged
  evidence:
    [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/feed-options-intent-store.ts#FeedOptionsIntentStore,
     github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/indexer-intent.ts#FeedOptionsIntent,
     github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#IndexEngine.takeFeedOptionsIntents,
     github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/index-engine.ts#IndexEngine.clearFeedOptionsIntents]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/index-core/src/feed-options-intent-store.test.ts]
  note: |
    Behaviour matches, and `IndexEngine` exposes the take/clear pass-throughs. The spec's FeedOptionsIntent is
    `{ spaceId, feedId, namespace, indexing?, retention? }`; the code has `{ kind, spaceId, feedId, namespace,
    options: Feed.FeedOptions }`, matching the table's single `options` column. Spec or type should be aligned.
```

